---
// Author bio — shown at the foot of articles and the Work With Me page.
---

<aside class="author-bio container">
  <div class="bio">
    <img
      src="/images/moscato-day-tuxedo.jpeg"
      alt="Maxwell"
      class="bio__photo"
    />
    <div class="bio__text">
      <p class="bio__name">Maxwell McCaulou</p>
      <p class="bio__copy">
        Maxwell is a Wine Director and wine writer based in the Pacific Northwest.
        He is currently buried in flashcards while preparing for the Advanced exam with the
        Court of Master Sommeliers. His favorite beverages are salsa, bubbles, iced espresso
        with an orange twist, and any Mexican-owned Blanco spirit, not necessarily in that
        order. Off the clock, he loves to read about psychology and exercise however the
        Seattle weather allows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
.author-bio {
  padding-block: 2.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--deep-cream);
  max-width: var(--prose-width);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .author-bio {
    max-width: clamp(44rem, 68vw, 64rem);
  }
}

.bio {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.bio__photo {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center top;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.bio__name {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
}

.bio__copy {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--muted-ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 52ch;
}
</style>
